<title>POLAND: NFI 3 nets PLN 11.5 mln H1.</title>
<headline>NFI 3 nets PLN 11.5 mln H1.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish National Investment Fund (NFI) No. 3 preliminary results for the first half of 1997, in millions of zlotys:</p>
<p>					H1 1997		   H1 1996</p>
<p>  Net profit			 11.05		     39.81 loss</p>
<p>  Investment portfolio	  374.84		    393.74</p>
<p>  Liabilities and provisions   32.15		     11.20</p>
<p>  Net assets			352.33		    383.34</p>
<p>  Assets per share (PLN)	 11.36		     10.95</p>
<p>NOTE: The full company name is Trzeci Narodowy Fundusz Inwestycyjny SA.  -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
